# Code owners (#1035): names the owner of these files. Enforced only on pull requests into `main`,
# which requires a code owner's review; work goes into `dev-*` branches, and gates bypass it by a
# fast-forward. Paths starting with `/` are from the repository's root; a path ending in `/` takes
# everything under it; where several lines match a file, the last one wins.

# The pages that handle keys, served straight from `main`: the API keys page (`api-keys.html`, #436)
